    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** Currently under renovation, expected completion November 2026***\r\n\r\n41 Saint Fintans Villas is a 3 bedroom, 3 bath semi-detached house situated in a quiet cul de sac location. The property is currently undergoing a comprehensive renovation and is due for completion in November 2026.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation will extend to approximately 102sqm (1,097sqft) and will\r\nprovide well-proportioned living accommodation together with 3 bedrooms, including 2 ensuites. The planned specification includes a fitted kitchen with granite worktops, underfloor heating and an air-to-water heat pump, with an A-rated BER anticipated on completion.\r\n\r\nThe property will also benefit from off-street parking to the front, a private rear garden and a gated side passage. The accommodation is arranged over two floors and comprises an entrance hall, living room, open-plan kitchen/dining/living area, bedroom and main bathroom on the ground floor and two bedrooms, both with ensuites on the first floor.\r\n\r\nPlease note: The property is currently under renovation and is expected to be completed in November 2026. The images accompanying this listing are AI-generated indicative images showing the anticipated finished appearance of the property and are not photographs of the property in its current condition. Finishes, fittings and details shown may vary from the final specification."
      },
